        ],
        "text": "The TPS program allows foreign nationals of a country designated by the Government as having unusually bad or dangerous conditions to live and work in the United States while the conditions last."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Court",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "722302f40908396c270408f2d7191953217f292f724dbd52bd645719192d0cc0",
