            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 7,
              "start": 7
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The Court granted certiorari to resolve a circuit split over whether a TPS recipient who entered the country unlawfully can become an LPR."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justices",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "9c25b7dc70335c165d03f6c6d6751edd7d9ad47cc51f79794ae856cbfcc8e2e4",
